    "details": "Chrome Releases reports:\n\n> This update includes 21 security fixes:\n>\n> - \\[576215540\\] Critical CVE-2026-76024: Memory corruption in\n>   MediaStream.\n> - \\[559780982\\] High CVE-2026-76025: Use after free in FileSystem.\n> - \\[567673200\\] High CVE-2026-76026: Memory corruption in Autofill.\n> - \\[568894475\\] High CVE-2026-76027: Memory corruption in\n>   CacheStorage.\n> - \\[569012015\\] High CVE-2026-76028: Use after free in FileSystem.\n> - \\[572055997\\] High CVE-2026-76029: Memory corruption in Network.\n> - \\[572269631\\] High CVE-2026-76030: Memory corruption in FileSystem.\n> - \\[572556403\\] High CVE-2026-76031: Use after free in Input.\n> - \\[573264074\\] High CVE-2026-119260: Use after free in Frames.\n> - \\[574213633\\] High CVE-2026-119261: Improper input validation in\n>   Skia.\n> - \\[574660146\\] High CVE-2026-119262: Improper input validation in V8.\n> - \\[575143870\\] High CVE-2026-119263: Memory corruption in\n>   GarbageCollection.\n> - \\[575150692\\] High CVE-2026-119264: Memory corruption in Dawn.\n> - \\[575201795\\] High CVE-2026-119265: Memory corruption in Quota.\n> - \\[575202553\\] High CVE-2026-119266: Use after free in Quota.\n> - \\[576203565\\] High CVE-2026-119267: Memory corruption in DOM.\n> - \\[576984708\\] High CVE-2026-119268: Integer overflow in Editing.\n> - \\[577072000\\] High CVE-2026-119269: Use after free in Blink.\n> - \\[577333729\\] High CVE-2026-119270: Improper input validation in\n>   CacheStorage.\n> - \\[577403270\\] High CVE-2026-119271: Use after free in Skia.\n> - \\[569012543\\] Medium CVE-2026-119272: Out of bounds read in\n>   FileSystem.\n",
